@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

state StartLogin <<choice>>
state UserChoice <<choice>>

[*] --> StartLogin

StartLogin --> TeacherLogin : register or log in as teacher
StartLogin --> StudentLogin : register or log in as student

TeacherLogin --> CreateQuiz : create a new quiz
CreateQuiz --> EditQuiz : edit an existing quiz
EditQuiz --> SaveDraft : save as draft
SaveDraft --> PostQuiz : post for students
PostQuiz --> ViewResults : view quiz results

StudentLogin --> SelectQuiz : select a quiz after notification
SelectQuiz --> AnswerQuiz : answer the selected quiz
AnswerQuiz --> SubmitQuiz : submit their quiz
SubmitQuiz --> ViewResult : view the result

@enduml
